### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### ============================================================
### BRANDING API (AllowAnonymous — also used by login & sidebar)
### ============================================================

### Get effective branding (AppName, FullName, DisplayName, LogoUrl)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/branding

### Get branding as authenticated user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/branding
Cookie: {{token}}
